# Language Test 202505 - ABC411F: Contraction
Kalivisku musope kas root vis parent kasta x {
    Sonome kas r tas x.
    Sonome kas next_x tas 0.
    Pilike palusta parent[r] != r {
        Kemese kas r tas parent[r].
    }
    Pilike palusta parent[x] != x {
        Kemese kas next_x tas parent[x].
        Kemese kas parent[x] tas r.
        Kemese kas x tas next_x.
    }
    Jasepe kas r.
}

Kalivisku musope kas contract vis parent kasta adj kasta a kasta b {
    Sonome kas ra tas Kisite kas root vis parent kasta a.
    Sonome kas rb tas Kisite kas root vis parent kasta b.
    Palusta ra kate rb {
        Jasepe kas 0.
    }
    Palusta kix (rb pas adj[ra]) {
        Jasepe kas 0.
    }

    Sonome kas small tas ra.
    Sonome kas large tas rb.
    Sonome kas tmp tas 0.
    Palusta (Kisite kas kipala vis adj[small]) > (Kisite kas kipala vis adj[large]) {
        Kemese kas tmp tas small.
        Kemese kas small tas large.
        Kemese kas large tas tmp.
    }

    Sonome kas removed tas 1.
    Kinise kas adj[small][large].
    Kinise kas adj[large][small].
    Pilike kas x pas adj[small] {
        Kinise kas adj[x][small].
        Palusta x pas adj[large] {
            removed += 1.
        } Japalusta {
            Putike kas x tas adj[large].
            Putike kas large tas adj[x].
        }
    }
    Kemese kas parent[small] tas large.
    Kemese kas adj[small] tas {}.
    Jasepe kas removed.
}

Sonome kas N kasta M tas Kisite kas readints vis 2.
Sonome kas parent tas [i Pilike kas i pas (Kisite kas pilika vis N)].
Sonome kas adj tas Kisite kas fill vis {} kasta N.
Sonome kas U tas Kisite kas fill vis 0 kasta M.
Sonome kas V tas Kisite kas fill vis 0 kasta M.
Sonome kas edge tas [0, 0].
Sonome kas u tas 0.
Sonome kas v tas 0.
Pilike kas i pas Kisite kas pilika vis M {
    Kemese kas edge tas Kisite kas readints vis 2.
    Kemese kas u tas edge[0] - 1.
    Kemese kas v tas edge[1] - 1.
    Kemese kas U[i] tas u.
    Kemese kas V[i] tas v.
    Putike kas v tas adj[u].
    Putike kas u tas adj[v].
}
Sonome kas Q tas Kisite kas readint.
Sonome kas queries tas Kisite kas readints vis Q.
Sonome kas edges tas M.
Sonome kas index tas 0.
Pilike kas q pas queries {
    Kemese kas index tas q - 1.
    edges -= Kisite kas contract vis parent kasta adj kasta U[index] kasta V[index].
    Takute kas edges.
}
